{{Term/Store|''Chef Aurie Taamu, Vol. 1''||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Object]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|Chef Aurie Taamu, Vol. 1|Game Screen|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|Chef Aurie Taamu, Vol. 1|Game Screen|TotK}}</ref>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
''Chef Aurie Taamu, Vol. 1'' is the first in a series of [[Cookbook]]s written by [[Aurie Taamu]].<ref>{{Cite|This collection of Aurie Taamu's notes is so amazing! I feel like I learn something new each time I read it.|Dina|BotW}}</ref> It can be found in the room where [[Ashai]] holds her [[Cooking Class]], where it is used by the students who attend it. This volume details [[Added Effect]]s that can be applied to [[Meal]]s, [[Elixir]], and the use of [[Fairy|Fairies]] while [[Cooking]].

The book has a light green cover that is decorated with dark green decoration. It is left open on a page showing a diagram on chopping [[Carrot]]s.

==={{TotK|-}}===
''Chef Aurie Taamu, Vol. 1'' can be found in [[Ashai]]'s [[House]] in [[Gerudo Town]]. Its contents remain unchanged. Due to Ashai's [[Cooking Class]] being put on hiatus, she has allowed the entire town access to the [[Book]].<ref>{{Cite|[Cooking class?] Before the sand shroud settled in, Ashai was teaching a cooking class here. You see, you can get really far in life—and in love—if you have a solid grasp of the essentials of cooking. But she has so many students now that her other class, "Voe and You," takes up all her time. So she's opened this place up for everyone's use. The {{Color TotK|Red|cookbooks}} here are really useful too. If you're planning to do any cooking at all, you should definitely give them a read.|Nellie|TotK}}</ref> Though the book is too high up for [[Link]] to read on his own, if he uses [[Ultrahand]] to bring over a [[Wooden Box]] to stand on, he will be able to access it.

